### Driver Cancellation Reasons

| Reason | Share |
|---|---|
| Customer Related Issues | 25.3% |
| Capacity Issues | 25.0% |
| Personal & Car Issues | 24.9% |
| Customer Behavior | 24.8% |

> Both customer and driver cancellation reasons are near-uniformly distributed — no single root cause dominates, indicating systemic friction across multiple dimensions simultaneously.

