## ⭐ Rating Analysis

| Vehicle Type | Customer Rating | Driver Rating |
|---|---|---|
| Go Sedan | **4.41** ⭐ | 4.24 |
| Auto | 4.40 | 4.23 |
| Go Mini | 4.40 | 4.23 |
| eBike / Bike | 4.40 | 4.23 |
| Premier Sedan | 4.40 | 4.24 |
| UberXL | 4.40 | **4.24** ⭐ |

- Customer ratings are consistently high across all vehicle types (4.40–4.41)
- Driver ratings are stable but slightly lower platform-wide (4.23–4.24)
- The narrow rating bands across all categories confirm platform-wide rating compression — a 4.0 score is a genuine warning signal, not mediocrity

---

## 💡 Key Takeaways

| Theme | Finding |
|---|---|
| **Supply** | ~11K "No Driver Found" events signal chronic supply shortages across all zones and vehicle types |
| **Cancellations** | ~27K driver cancellations are near-uniformly split across four root causes — no single fix suffices |
| **Revenue** | Auto and Go Mini drive the majority of platform revenue; eBike and Uber XL are operationally marginal |
| **Pricing** | Booking value is only moderately correlated with distance (r=0.42); vehicle type and surge matter more |
| **Demand** | Evening peak (18:00) dominates; weekends generate ~50% more revenue than weekdays |
| **Payments** | UPI dominates real transactions; ~48K unclassified records require data quality remediation |
| **Ratings** | Inflation compresses scores into 4.0–5.0; a 4.0 rating is a genuine quality warning, not a mediocre score |

---

## 📌 Strategic Recommendations

Based on the full EDA, the following priority actions are recommended:

**1. Fix Driver Cancellations**
- Introduce dynamic cancellation penalties to disincentivise selective ride rejection
- Add group size capture at booking to eliminate overcrowding cancellations
- Develop driver wellness scheduling to reduce personal/car-related cancellation rates

**2. Solve the Supply Coverage Gap**
- Deploy targeted driver incentives in zones with highest "No Driver Found" rates
- Pre-position drivers during 17:00–19:00 evening peak using demand forecasting

**3. Maximise Weekend Revenue**
- Activate driver weekend bonus schemes to match the ~50% premium demand
- Strengthen Friday evening surge pricing to capture untapped weekend gateway demand

**4. Remediate Data Quality**
- Investigate and reclassify ~48K "Not Applicable" payment records
- Add granular sub-reasons to the "Customer-Related" driver cancellation category
- Enrich the dataset with surge multiplier and zone-level supply-demand ratios

**5. Leverage Growth Channels**
- Drive Uber Wallet adoption — wallet users are high-frequency, high-loyalty customers
- Invest further in Auto and Go Mini supply — these two categories generate ~₹2.33Cr combined
- Formally review eBike and Uber XL positioning with a clear strategic decision on each

