| **Geographic Scope** | ✅ Multi-location | Multiple pickup and drop zones across Delhi |
| **Class Balance** | ✅ Good | Representation across all vehicle types and time periods |
| **Payment Classification** | ⚠️ Needs Review | ~48K "Not Applicable" records require investigation |

---

## 💡 Use Cases

This dataset supports the following analytical and machine learning applications:

- **Cancellation Prediction** — classifiers to predict booking cancellation risk before a driver accepts
- **Revenue Forecasting** — time-series modelling of daily and weekly booking value
- **Supply-Demand Modelling** — identify underserved zones and hours using "No Driver Found" events cross-referenced with time and location
- **Driver Performance Analysis** — cluster drivers by rating, cancellation rate, and earnings efficiency
- **Customer Segmentation** — segment riders by vehicle preference, payment method, and booking frequency
- **Pricing Optimisation** — surface surge pricing patterns by analysing fare variance unexplained by distance
- **Rating Inflation Research** — study bilateral rating behaviour and its relationship to actual ride outcomes

